                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                        "entry_id": "eaf348ee-10e6-3138-b6b1-aede4e5609b1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A barn for cows."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1acbc66d-8313-482a-918c-d2c3b506ed44",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "275 feet of pipes have been laid from dairy to cowbarn to convey the milk after it has passed through the Separator, back to the barn, while it is still warm just right for the calves."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee123da4-02b8-422c-9517-e1000d6587a2",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "They found an old coat of his this morning on the bank by Manter’s cowbarn,—boy brought it up to the rectory; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cce504c7-42c1-40fb-b634-36afe4d75df9",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "Here, as has been mentioned, the manure from the cowbarns is thrown out daily and dried in the sunshine, a process favored through the greater part of the year by the aridity of the climate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff7f6f02-dedc-4fe7-884d-a7ffe84c0d9c",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "Aside from the $4500 residence, $5000 has been spent in other improvements such as stable, cowbarns, fences and ice house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6a2c6c1-ade9-41b0-824c-743ad30ff501",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "The deadly gasses from dung in the cowbarn ruin her digestion—poison her hay and other foods—sap her vitality and prevent her from giving you a maximum supply of good milk. Ventilate Your Cowbarn with an ILG FARM BARN POWER VENTILATOR"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80487d04-0d3e-4a5f-a610-89f6b7795201",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "Most had vines creeping up their walls and gardens or large courts with old cowbarns and dovecotes, relics of the time when they were farmsteads in open country, before the town had expanded to embrace them. […] It was of light-colored stone, two stories with a stable or cowbarn tucked in below and an old dovecote rising like a tower to one side."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f6498f9-2793-4dc1-8c85-59ee7850d7a1",
                                "sense_id": "9c1c24fd-c8cd-3863-9d96-74bd179193c3",
                                "text": "While walking in the orchard a few days later, the boys took a shortcut to the cowbarns. […] The cowbarn was below in the back of the house with several cattle in the barnyard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
